  "releaseNotes": "Alpha. A filter can now be written over the objects the library hands back: sessions.Matching(s => s.Name.StartsWith(\"build\")) translates, where before only a projection row whose properties were spelled like tmux fields did. net8.0 consumers now take an 8.0 logging abstraction rather than a 10.0 one. The public API is not settled and may change without notice between prereleases; pin an exact version.",
